      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elizabethtown%2C_Illinois"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Elizabethtown serves as the county seat of Hardin County, making it the smallest county seat in the state of Illinois.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14,
